WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.100
- Hey guys, Dr. Berg here.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.280
In this video, we're gonna share with you

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:06.170
the power of intermittent fasting, okay?

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.470
Now, intermittent fasting is a tool.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:11.520
It's not a diet. It doesn't
tell you what to eat.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.151
It's a pattern of eating. Okay?

00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:17.630
It's a pattern of eating and not eating.

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:19.210
It's not about cutting calories.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:23.500
It's just changing when you
eat and when you don't eat.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.230
Okay. So that's what
we're gonna talk about.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.360
So why would you want to do this anyway?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.360
Because it is one, if not
the most important factors

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.660
in weight loss, okay?

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:37.830
Let's talk about why.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:42.230
Because it triggers two
main hormones in your body.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.070
The most powerful ones,
one is growth hormone,

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.820
which is anti-aging and the

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.440
most powerful fat-burning hormone.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.080
There are six fat-burning hormones.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.400
Growth hormone is the most
powerful fat-burning hormone

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.060
to protect your muscles,
to build lean body mass,

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:58.853
and also just to lose actual fat, okay?

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:00.840
And then you have insulin.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:05.180
Insulin is also a very powerful
hormone in that it actually

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.430
will help you store fat if
you want to gain weight,

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.680
which you don't want to do
that, you want to lose weight.

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.870
But here's the thing, in
the presence of insulin,

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:13.920
you cannot lose weight.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.440
It's such a dominating hormone,

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:17.790
it will block growth hormone.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:21.170
So it's the hormone that makes you fat.

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.860
It's the hormone that gives you the gut.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:24.780
If you see someone with a fat gut,

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:26.130
they have too much insulin.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.250
So these are the two powerful hormones

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.960
that you're gonna influence.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.570
Now, let's look at what's happening.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:38.570
This tool or technique can
really heal insulin resistance,

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:44.110
where you have the pancreas
pumping out way more insulin

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.810
than you need, five to seven times,

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.520
because what happens when
you have too much insulin,

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.160
the cells start blocking it
and then your body doesn't get

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:54.400
to return communication.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.230
So it's like talking to your
child and they have ear plugs.

00:01:57.230 --> 00:01:59.370
You're gonna increase your
volume because the person

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.380
is ignoring you.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:03.340
There's no two-way communication.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:06.024
So if the pancreas
doesn't get the feedback

00:02:06.024 --> 00:02:07.830
that the insulin is connecting,

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:12.830
it sends more insulin through the channel.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.350
So you have a situation where you

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.973
have resistance of
insulin, it's not working,

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:19.990
low insulin in the cell, low glucose,

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.410
but then you have high amounts
of insulin in other places,

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:25.630
which is very destructive
because it's pre-diabetes,

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:27.890
creates a lot of problems, okay?

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:30.100
So what we want to do is we
want to start where you're at,

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.190
and then graduate this way over time.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.210
It's kind of like there's different levels

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.860
of intermittent fasting from
not intermittent fasting

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.810
to some serious fat burning over here.

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.059
So let's say you start
with five meals a day

00:02:44.059 --> 00:02:45.570
or six meals a day.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.040
You have breakfast, lunch, snacks.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:48.790
Some people do breakfast, snack, lunch,

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:51.020
snack, dinner, snack, right?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:53.093
That's a lot of people that do that.

00:02:53.093 --> 00:02:57.250
The principle of intermittent
fasting hormonally is that

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:01.500
every time you eat you spike insulin.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.470
See, people have thought that only when

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:05.010
you eat carbohydrates, you spike insulin.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:05.843
No, no, no.

00:03:05.843 --> 00:03:08.290
Eating in general will
increase insulin regardless

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.330
of what you eat.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.740
Even a snack, even if it's healthy.

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:15.090
So we have a situation where
this person's spiking insulin

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:15.923
all day long.

00:03:15.923 --> 00:03:20.200
Our bodies are not designed
to eat and graze all day long.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:22.100
So we want to switch to three meals a day

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:23.900
with no snacks, okay?

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:27.570
So that's the first step,
three meals a day, no snacking.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:30.170
The ability to go from
one meal to the next,

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:34.771
without being hungry,
involves eating more fat.

00:03:34.771 --> 00:03:36.170
So you have to add more fat to that meal.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.620
I'm gonna put some
links down, what to eat.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:40.040
But this video is not about what to eat.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:42.230
It's about the pattern.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:44.140
So you get three meals here,

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.950
and then if you want to take
it to the next level and burn

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:50.310
even more fat, you want to
do a pattern of 16 to eight,

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:55.310
16 hours of fasting and
eight hour window of eating.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.240
So let's say you get up in the morning

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.120
and you're not hungry.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:01.590
Well, don't eat. Wait until you're hungry.

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.590
The ideal situation is to go
four hours when you wake up,

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.560
at least four hours before
you eat the first meal.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:14.560
So let's say, you eat at
10 o'clock in the morning.

